# Data Flow Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as ⏰ Scheduler
    participant F as ⚡ Function
    participant V as 🔑 Secrets Vault
    participant SFTP as 📁 SFTP Server
    participant PE as 🔐 Private Endpoint
    participant ST as 💾 Object Storage
    participant L as 📊 Logging

    Note over S,L: Daily File Transfer Workflow
    
    S->>F: 1. Trigger Function (2:00 AM)
    activate F
    
    F->>L: 2. Log: Execution started
    F->>V: 3. Request SFTP credentials
    activate V
    V-->>F: 4. Return encrypted credentials
    deactivate V
    
    F->>SFTP: 5. Establish SSH/SFTP connection
    activate SFTP
    SFTP-->>F: 6. Connection established
    
    F->>SFTP: 7. List files / Download files
    SFTP-->>F: 8. Return file data
    deactivate SFTP
    
    F->>L: 9. Log: Files downloaded
    
    F->>PE: 10. Upload files via HTTPS
    activate PE
    PE->>ST: 11. Store files (private connection)
    activate ST
    ST-->>PE: 12. Upload confirmation
    deactivate ST
    PE-->>F: 13. Success response
    deactivate PE
    
    F->>L: 14. Log: Transfer completed
    L-->>F: 15. Logs stored
    
    deactivate F
    
    Note over ST: Lifecycle policies activate
    Note over ST: Day 30: → Infrequent Access
    Note over ST: Day 90: → Archive
    Note over ST: Day 180: → Deep Archive
```

