# Security Architecture (Defense in Depth)

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Layer1["Layer 1: Network Isolation"]
        L1_1["Private Subnets Only"]
        L1_2["No Public IPs"]
        L1_3["No Internet Gateway for Storage"]
    end
    
    subgraph Layer2["Layer 2: Firewall Controls"]
        L2_1["Security Groups / NSGs"]
        L2_2["Deny All Ingress"]
        L2_3["Minimal Egress Rules"]
    end
    
    subgraph Layer3["Layer 3: Identity & Access"]
        L3_1["Least Privilege IAM"]
        L3_2["Service Accounts"]
        L3_3["No Long-term Credentials"]
    end
    
    subgraph Layer4["Layer 4: Encryption"]
        L4_1["TLS/HTTPS in Transit"]
        L4_2["SSH/SFTP Encryption"]
        L4_3["AES-256 at Rest"]
    end
    
    subgraph Layer5["Layer 5: Secrets Management"]
        L5_1["Encrypted Vault"]
        L5_2["No Hardcoded Credentials"]
        L5_3["Automatic Rotation"]
    end
    
    subgraph Layer6["Layer 6: Monitoring & Audit"]
        L6_1["Comprehensive Logging"]
        L6_2["Access Audit Trails"]
        L6_3["Anomaly Detection"]
    end
    
    Internet[/"Internet / External Threats"/]
    
    Internet --> Layer1
    Layer1 --> Layer2
    Layer2 --> Layer3
    Layer3 --> Layer4
    Layer4 --> Layer5
    Layer5 --> Layer6
    
    Layer6 --> Core["🔐 Protected Core:<br/>Serverless Function<br/>+<br/>Object Storage"]
    
    classDef threatStyle fill:#dc3545,stroke:#bd2130,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef defenseStyle fill:#28a745,stroke:#1e7e34,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef coreStyle fill:#007bff,stroke:#0056b3,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    
    class Internet threatStyle
    class L1_1,L1_2,L1_3,L2_1,L2_2,L2_3,L3_1,L3_2,L3_3,L4_1,L4_2,L4_3,L5_1,L5_2,L5_3,L6_1,L6_2,L6_3 defenseStyle
    class Core coreStyle
```

