# Cost Optimization Strategy

```mermaid
graph TD
    Start["Traditional Architecture<br/>EC2 + NAT Gateway<br/>💲 $65-100/month"]
    
    subgraph Optimizations["Cost Optimization Strategies"]
        O1["✅ Use Serverless Compute<br/>Pay-per-use, no idle costs<br/>💲 Save $40-60/month"]
        O2["✅ Private Endpoint<br/>No NAT Gateway needed<br/>💲 Save $32-45/month"]
        O3["✅ Storage Lifecycle<br/>Auto-tier to cheaper storage<br/>💲 Save 50-80% on storage"]
        O4["✅ Log Retention<br/>7-30 days only<br/>💲 Save $5-10/month"]
        O5["✅ Right-sized Resources<br/>512MB function memory<br/>💲 Optimal cost/performance"]
    end
    
    End["Optimized Architecture<br/>Serverless + Private Endpoint<br/>💲 $2.80-9.73/month<br/><br/>💰 90-95% Cost Reduction"]
    
    Start --> O1
    O1 --> O2
    O2 --> O3
    O3 --> O4
    O4 --> O5
    O5 --> End
    
    classDef expensiveStyle fill:#dc3545,stroke:#bd2130,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef optimizedStyle fill:#28a745,stroke:#1e7e34,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef savingsStyle fill:#ffc107,stroke:#d39e00,stroke-width:2px
    
    class Start expensiveStyle
    class End optimizedStyle
    class O1,O2,O3,O4,O5 savingsStyle
```

